# Public SVG gradients, round/butt/square caps, joins/dashes and a 5000-point plot.
size 80x15
dpr 1
search-terminal
feed "SVG gradient / dashed caps and joins / dense translucent plot"
overlay shapes
render-terminal
screenshot shapes-1x
expect-ink-px 35:180-600:285 2% 35%
dpr 2
search-terminal
feed "SVG gradient / dashed caps and joins / dense translucent plot"
overlay shapes
render-terminal
screenshot shapes-2x
expect-ink-px 70:360-1200:570 2% 35%
